[en.DECISION_C18_NIRIKS_CONTROL]
Mind Control: §7Suppress Anger§!

[en.DECISION_C18_NIRIKS_CONTROL_desc]
Use dark magic to influence the minds of the Kirins, manipulating their emotions. This way we can §Greduce§! their anger and suppress the trend of Nirikization.
Although we are not sure if this is the right thing to do, desperate times call for desperate measures. Since Autumn Blaze believes this is the right course of action, we can only trust her judgment.

[en.DECISION_C18_NIRIKS_CONTROL_TOOLTIP]
During the §7Suppress Anger§!: $C18_DEL_GROWTH_0_10_TOOLTIP$

[zh.DECISION_C18_NIRIKS_CONTROL]
心灵控制：§7压制愤怒§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_NIRIKS_CONTROL_desc]
使用黑魔法影响麒麟们的心智，左右他们的情绪。这样我们可以§G减少§!他们的愤怒，从而抑制逆麟化趋势。
虽然不确定这样做是否正确，但极端情况需要极端手段，既然秋烨这样认为，我们也只能相信她的判断了。

[zh.DECISION_C18_NIRIKS_CONTROL_TOOLTIP]
§7压制愤怒§!持续期间：$C18_DEL_GROWTH_0_10_TOOLTIP$
